{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-17","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与连比例与比例","englishTitle":"If there be as many numbers as we please in continued proportion, and the extremes of them be prime to one another, the last will not be to any other number as the first to the second.","book":9,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.17/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","contentId":"euclid-9-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e22d97da7e58a1f29200211e28044a4899545c753660ea40e7bc7ba370ec85a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-17.statement","euclid-9-17.construction.1","euclid-9-17.proof.1","euclid-9-17.proof.2","euclid-9-17.proof.3","euclid-9-17.proof.4","euclid-9-17.proof.5","euclid-9-17.proof.6","euclid-9-17.proof.7","euclid-9-17.proof.8","euclid-9-17.conclusion","euclid-9-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb06c608b0efc42a2454c5d8c1a947a25bfb3a205eaead3d8dac0470bf508c7d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be as many numbers as we please in continued proportion, and the extremes of them be prime to one another, the last will not be to any other number as the first to the second."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果连比例有我们想要的号码 最极端的是互素, 最后的号码不会是第一个到第二个号码"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2bc3ca920d6514c33fb61526e0d918844c13f3005fdce83d99b9fbb8f6eb980c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let there be as many numbers as we please, A, B, C, D, in continued proportion, and let the extremes of them, A, D, be prime to one another; I say that D is not to any other number as A is to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们想多少就有多少,连比例有A,B,C,D, 最极端的A,D,互素;我说D不是任何其他数字,A是B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf434e8c14934595bd715f819e6429d92a4f3b899e7b7cbafa57007dc0c9061b","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, as A is to B, so let D be to E; therefore, alternately, as A is to D, so is B to E. [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能,A比B,那么D比E;因此,A比D等于B比E；A 与 D 之比等于 B 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d067a638f2d7c78cd2d1837312e8b9c08ed931c07ff5d61abaacea85871e70e0","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, D are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least numbers measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent. [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,D是质数,质数也是最少的,而最小的整除个比例相同,前身和随后的前后。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b34506ba9ff11c8abdb4347da2f3e41901938aae77a6d4af6719a81209c9e8df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A 整除 B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1376c5c6488ced792a2884b6582429906579c6ac6ee89eb896cc0fd230a612db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as A is to B, so is B to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比B等于B比C；A 与 B 之比等于 B 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f0fc8f285ae47491c88eca1f827d4e8b741e1b49204be9342ca1bda147886e6c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore B also measures C; so that A also measures C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,B也是整除 C;A也是整除 C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"905760714ed00234565f53684a3f0a21c0cbead72ef27f8866112141ffdedd74","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as B is to C, so is C to D, and B measures C, therefore C also measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B对C的比等于C对D和B对,C,C,因此,C与整除和D；B 与 C 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b290a4aa24b559712bd07855fe7bbd267f2e651ccfe6856bd679c709e28668e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A measured C; so that A also measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A度为C,A度也是整除 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93174b2982c871c8e8974577bbb36576ae7c39b6b7b8f95fad2b7ad421c69292","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures itself; therefore A measures A, D which are prime to one another : which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它本身也整除;因此,A 整除 A,D, 即互素:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d15aa42d55ef2c2d78611ccf625849d3d37d943a9302a00f85f6d9d969248667","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D will not be to any other number as A is to B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，不存在任何其他整数，使 D 与该整数之比等于 A 与 B 之比。证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-17.source","contentId":"euclid-9-17","revisionId":"euclid-9-17@raw-4e22d97da7e58a1f","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d40d790a3ee8dd146de9fbe4e8184f58aa53ed829b1df92a2089f19a23ded35a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.17/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.17\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-17:euclid-7-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-17.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"VII. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-17:euclid-7-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-17.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"VII. 21"}},{"id":"e